# Cabass's sub-banks, first 10 then 20: each autoencoder on a slice of c0, for latent 3 and 2. After each set,
# the bank sizes and the plot with every model trained so far, in files ..._sb10 and ..._sb20.
# Needs the data, train_ae3 and train_ae2 steps of svd_ae.dag (done). Submit from this folder:
#   condor_submit_dag svd_ae_subbanks.dag
# At most 40 CPUs at once: 20 trainings x 2 CPUs (10 sub-banks), then 40 x 1 (20 sub-banks); 50 x 1 to count.

